      "wikidata": "Q6181243",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Jeremy Wayne Clements (born January 16, 1985) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He competes full-time in the NASCAR O'Reilly Auto Parts Series, driving the No. 51 Chevrolet Camaro SS for Jeremy Clements Racing. He is the son of Tony Clements, owner of Clements Racing Engines.\n\nClements holds the record for the most starts by a driver in O'Reilly Auto Parts Series history.",
